  = must: confirm future file inventory, fixture inventory, expected-ledger inventory, generated-output boundary, dependency boundary, adapter boundary, dispatch boundary, live-control deferral boundary, command plan, and proof gate for implementation slices
  = must: preserve accepted IR8 source authority, manager planning record, readiness projection, work packet, proof obligation, completion gate, handoff, human override, refusal, fault, dry-run evidence, generated-output, dispatch, credential, network, operations safety, and no-live-control semantics without implementation code creation in this slice
  = must: keep package dependency changes, adapters, transports, UI, dispatch mechanisms, live-control APIs, command execution beyond validation commands, process control, GPU control, model runtime control, job dispatch, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem actions, and live machine control gated until IR8-IA07 or a later dependency-authorizing slice
