& [ConfirmedCommandPlan: IR8IntegratedManager] is the command and verification plan for future implementation slices
  + [baseline_compile_command] is python -m compileall -q src tests
  + [baseline_test_command] is python -m unittest discover -s tests
  + [targeted_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir8_integrated_manager_contracts
  + [diff_hygiene_command] is git diff --check
  + [generated_output_review] is prove generated projections and reports are ignored, disposable, reproducible, and non-authoritative
  + [no_dispatch_review] is prove manager outputs remain records and packets, not dispatch effects
  + [no_live_effect_review] is prove commands, processes, GPU, model runtimes, jobs, credentials, network state, destructive filesystem targets, platform mailboxes, source docs, and expected ledgers are not mutated by projection code or tests

  = must: run baseline tests and diff hygiene after every future slice
  = should: run compile check after code slices begin
  = must: run targeted contract tests once tests.test_ir8_integrated_manager_contracts exists

